<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Vogels posts yr attrib profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Vogels posts yr attrib profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		117	   vs   36</p>
<p>    - attrib		   71	   vs   36</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  70	   vs   30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    13.31	vs    6.69</p>
<p>    Tax			   0.30	vs    0.03</p>
<p>    Interest received	 2.14	vs    0.81</p>
<p>    Investment income	20.99	vs    5.95</p>
<p>Div payable: October 1</p>
<p>On register: August 29</p>
<p>Full name: Vogelstruisbult Metal Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - As a result of a change in the company's reporting period from December 31 to June 30 last year, the comparative figures reflected in this report cover the six month period ended June 30 1996.</p>
<p>The company said headline earnings were stated after the exclusion of the amounts attributable to members in respect of surpluses on the realisation of strategic investments and amounts written off investments.</p>
<p>Earnings were boosted by substantially increased dividends from Zinc Corp of South Africa Ltd.</p>
